<title>JAPAN: Bank of Nagoya - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Nagoya - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    46.46		vs	   53.31</p>
<p> Operating	    7.32		vs	    7.52</p>
<p> Current		2.17		vs	    5.17</p>
<p> Net		    2.11		vs	    2.12</p>
<p> EPS		   10.43 yen	  vs	   10.49 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    202 million	  vs	 202 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Nagoya Ltd is a regional bank operating in the Chubu area.</p>
